  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Unholy Sword_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e2ee27bf666a314f83bead6bb84970e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 7411909391458763517
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 56289652736
    m_Localized: "{global.playerName}, it\u2019s been a while. Still living as far
      away as possible from us, I see?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7411909391458763517
  - m_Id: 596750888960
    m_Localized: "Life\u2019s good away from you phonies. And you're still opening
      my door without knocking\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1319404302336
    m_Localized: "Oh, I forget these formalities from your time spent with the humans.
      Which brings me to why I am here... \n\nThe Fort of Don Bas... has fallen under
      human dominion."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991084339200
    m_Localized: The Fort of Don Bas? Good riddance. That place was a dump anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2213348896768
    m_Localized: "And it\u2019s about to get worse\u2026 these humans have instated
      a democracy in the fort. It won\u2019t stop there. Soon, the rest of the Depths
      will be \u201Ccontaminated\u201D with talks of holidays, time off, maternity
      leave, safety insurances\u2026\n\nCan you imagine slimes demanding pay raises
      just for sweeping the floors?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3352718995456
    m_Localized: "Decency? Down here in the Depths? God forbid. \n\nBut anyway, I
      don\u2019t work for money anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4216275857408
    m_Localized: "Then name your price, my friend. Everything\u2019s negotiable."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4293136478208
    m_Localized: "I want out of here. I thought of it for a while... It\u2019s time
      for me to leave the Depths.\r\n<> I want to drink margaritas on the beach again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4422845329408
    m_Localized: Up above? You always did like to stick out like a sore thumb among
      humans. But if that's your dying wish. I'm sure Dreg can be convinced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4600721567744
    m_Localized: Come see him at his keep. Oh, and careful with the road. My cousin
      skeletons won't be happy to see you. And your...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4792883605504
    m_Localized: Axe? Yes. It really rattles them... I wonder why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4970961170432
    m_Localized: Don't take it personally. Might have something to do with half of
      them being down here because of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11348962439168
    m_Localized: Before heading out, prepare a health potion at the cauldron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11451152461824
    m_Localized: To prepare an health potion, pickup a Fell Oculli.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11540218507264
    m_Localized: You'll also need gelatine to bind the potion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13254241808384
    m_Localized: Meet Dreg at his keep to negotiate your price for defeating the
      invaders of Fort Don Bas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13997426339840
    m_Localized: Defeat the skeleton to unlock the next gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14576827494400
    m_Localized: Pick up the bow and arrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14675724988416
    m_Localized: You will need to shoot the target with your bow in order to unlock
      the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14827776897024
    m_Localized: These thorns are in your way! You need to burn them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14900225110016
    m_Localized: Pick up the fire spell. You can use it to burn down the thorns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15002742288384
    m_Localized: To cast magic, you need mana points. If you drain your mana points,
      you can pick up this potion to refill them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23777255616512
    m_Localized: Rest at the bonfire to heal. You can level up and travel to other
      bonfires too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
